{
  "iri": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_196955",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A secondary carboxamide resulting from the formal condensation of the carboxy group of (3'<i>S</i>)-2'-oxo-1',2',5,7-tetrahydrospiro[cyclopenta[<em>b</em>]pyridine-6,3'-pyrrolo[2,3-<em>b</em>]pyridine]-3-carboxylic acid with the amino group of (3<i>S</i>,5<i>S</i>,6<i>R</i>)-3-amino-6-methyl-1-(2,2,2-trifluoroethyl)-5-(2,3,6-trifluorophenyl)piperidin-2-one. It is a selective oral, small-molecule antagonist of calcitonin gene-related peptide (CGRP) receptor that has been approved for the treatment of migraine."
  ],
